## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00 — Thứ Hai: Daily standup

> *"Morning. This week is databases, which is the part I know least. I decided to write raw SQL before touching an ORM, because I didn't want the ORM to hide things I don't understand yet.*
> *Today I designed the schema on paper first, then wrote the DDL by hand. The decision I care most about is a unique constraint on user ID plus client ID. Back in October I made writes idempotent on the mobile side using client-generated UUIDs — today I added the database constraint that actually enforces it. Application logic can have bugs; the constraint can't.*
> *I also seeded ten thousand rows and ran EXPLAIN ANALYZE. Sequential scan, then I added a composite index and it became an index scan. I wrote down both numbers.*
> *Tomorrow: Drizzle and migrations."*

**5 từ mới:**

| Từ / cụm | Nghĩa | Câu mẫu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `raw SQL` | SQL viết tay | *I wrote raw SQL before touching an ORM.* |
| `enforce` (v) | cưỡng chế, đảm bảo | *The constraint enforces it.* |
| `seed` (v) | đổ dữ liệu mẫu | *I seeded ten thousand rows.* |
| `composite index` | index nhiều cột | *I added a composite index.* |
| `hide things from me` | giấu đi | *I didn't want the ORM to hide things.* |

